OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA warm
OL,6,Fevening with plenty of late sunshine.
OL,7,FStaying largely dry overnight although
OL,8,Fthe odd light shower can't be entirely
OL,9,Fruled out. Warmer than recent nights.
OL,10,
OL,11,CSunday:FSmall chance of a brief shower
OL,12,Ffirst thing but otherwise another dry
OL,13,Fday is expected with prolonged periods
OL,14,Fof strong sunshine. Warmer than on
OL,15,FSaturday, perhaps hot for some.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
